EAD_STARTER\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888489.000150\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}], \"depends_on\": [\"summary:s1\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d2\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"In the QA tutor’s thread, a tutor distinguishes a loanword from an unrequested whole-sentence language change but does not give a task-specific handling decision.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937462.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937414.000152\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U013\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937462.000113\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U019\", \"relation\": \"THREAD_STARTER\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937462.000113\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U019\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937414.000152\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}], \"depends_on\": [\"summary:s1\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action\", \"kind\": \"ACTION\", \"text\": \"Post a reminder. Instruction: Post a reminder explaining the current loanword rule, while keeping task-specific judgments separate and preserving the existing request for context. Draft to copy: Reminder on loanwords and code-switching:\\n- Ordinary loanwords are acceptable and are not automatically code-switching errors. Check the requested output language and context first.\\n- For a monolingual requirement, an unexplained paragraph in another language counts against language adherence.\\n- A user mixing languages does not itself define the required output language.\\n\\nThis clarifies the general rule, not the judgment for either individual task. For the tutor who asked in the general-channel thread, please provide the user language instruction and switched span there, as requested, so language QA can assess the case. Scope: Restate the current project rule only; the request for case details applies to the tutor’s general-channel thread, not automatically to every thread.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888489.000150\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937414.000152\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888583.000226\", \"k:multilingual-eval-faq@1.1:8508b653\", \"k:multilingual-eval-instructions@1.2:0d37b1fa\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888541.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937462.000113\"], \"premises\": [{\"statement_id\": \"claim:c1\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c2\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c3\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c5\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c7\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c8\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action:rationale\", \"kind\": \"ACTION_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Why this helps: The current FAQ and instructions directly answer the shared rule question. Restating them addresses the repeated uncertainty without turning a tutor’s explanation into policy or deciding a case without context.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888489.000150\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937414.000152\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888583.000226\", \"k:multilingual-eval-faq@1.1:8508b653\", \"k:multilingual-eval-instructions@1.2:0d37b1fa\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888541.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937462.000113\", \"k:slack:C_MULTI_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790861853.000153:923cb61d\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action:need\", \"kind\": \"INTERVENTION_NEED\", \"text\": \"Why intervening now is needed (an unresolved handling question): The same distinction is being asked about in two threads, and the QA tutor’s task-handling question remains only partly answered.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888489.000150\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937414.000152\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937462.000113\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"announcement:k:slack:C_MULTI_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790861853.000153:923cb61d\", \"kind\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT_HANDLING\", \"text\": \"This announcement applies to this topic and directs current handling: \\\"Add affected task references here; no policy change has been announced.\\\". The announcement concerns mixed-language scoring in the same project and batch, and its context reply addresses the loanword distinction. Its directive governs where affected task references are collected, not escalation or a designated language QA intake route; the reminder relies on the current FAQ and instructions instead.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:slack:C_MULTI_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790861853.000153:923cb61d\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_abdb4e7868561f8ead92d84f\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_abdb4e7868561f8ead92d84f is UNRESOLVED: The tutor’s question receives a QA tutor’s context question and the team lead’s request for evidence, but no substantive answer or case assessment in the provided thread.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888489.000150\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888541.000113\", \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888583.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_0d9ef512697df0da04af0c03\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_0d9ef512697df0da04af0c03 is PARTIALLY_RESOLVED: A tutor answers the general distinction, but the QA tutor’s request for the correct handling of the task is not answered.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937414.000152\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937462.000113\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:rationale\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Severity LOW: A tutor and a QA tutor seek clarification of a distinction already addressed by current guidance. The messages do not report incorrect scores, conflicting QA decisions, or an inability to continue work.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888489.000150\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937414.000152\", \"m:C_MULTI_QA:1790937462.000113\"]}], \"member_threads\": [{\"evidence_id\": \"m:C_MULTI_GENERAL:1790888489.000150\", \"origin\": \"member_message\", \"use\": \"MEMBER_REPORT\", \"member_id\": \"